Maximum absolute slot difference: 2.832858292855221e-10, at period=2.1,
body=4, gap=6, angle=0, height=.7 period. This is a measured comparison,
not a claim of bitwise invariance under arbitrary unit changes.
In the most sensitive case, the reordered physical-gap calculation changes
the normalized gap by -2.842170943040401e-14. Feeding identical normalized
gap inputs to old and new cells gives bitwise identical coefficient arrays.

